# LMSH: LLM Shell

This document show how to launch LLM shell

## 1. Context
- OS/Kernel: Windows


## 2. Instructions
- Complete part or full of DAG (makefile) to meet user intent
- Only run a target using **Command** if no dependency found
- If a target has dependencies, make sure all of its dependency targets completed
- If target got failure, do not execute its parent target


## 3. Workflow


```makefile
set_workdir:
    # Description: set working directory
    # Command: `cd ~/echo-home/workstation/lmstudio/promptia`
list_inventory:
    # Description: list available lmsh shell
    # Command:`cat ~/echo-home/.vim/pages/lmsh.md | grep '^|'` 
    # Output: <AGENT_SHELL>, <LLM_PORT>
activate_shell: set_workdir list_inventory
    # Description: launch agent shell by name
    # Command: `wingterm ./<AGENT_SHELL> --port <LLM_PORT>`
    # Failure: any error
    # Input <AGENT_SHELL>
```


